---
description: Route bounded code changes through the agent-control-plane workflow when it is present.
alwaysApply: true
---

For code-changing work, use the `agent-control-plane-transaction` skill and follow the repository's
`AGENTS.md` and `agent-control-plane/STACK.md`. Surface every required approval to the user; this rule
is guidance, not authorization, and never permits self-approval. Ordinary read-only investigation and
simple questions do not need the control-plane workflow.
